  abstract={In order to achieve efficient management of RDF data, many scholars advocate the use of management RDF graph model approach to managing data, process the query is converted to sub-graph matching process. As the complexity of sub-graph matching algorithms, it needs to shrinke range in matching process, every narrowing the scope of the process also requires a match, which consumes some time. Considering the characteristics of RDF data with labels, we improved an index structure which can improve the efficiency of RDF data management.},
